    "Name": "Devastator",
    "Details": "A Star League era mech designed to correct the flaws of the original Titan, the Devastator was rediscovered by the FedSuns in 3023. Powered by a 400-rated XXL engine, the Devastator DVS-X10 (Muse Earth) carries a pair of Heavy PPC’s and a pair of Medium VSPL’s. A Supercharger and MASC help the design accelerate to 108 km/h when going flat out. Reactive armor and 16 DHS round out the design. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Hyper-Extending Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
